  {
    title: 'The craft side: a GI-tagged trade under real economic pressure',
    listItems: [
      'The Kolhapuri chappal is a Geographical Indication (GI) tagged, hand-stitched leather craft rooted in artisan clusters across Kolhapur and the wider region',
