    title: 'Online guidance can sit alongside family and trade conversations, not compete with them',
    body: 'When a family trade, a cooperative-society tie, or an akhada commitment is part of the picture, the harder conversations often need to include family. Online sessions make it easier to include that context and join from wherever you already are, instead of adding travel and logistics on top of an already sensitive decision.',
