---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Kolhapur</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Kolhapur
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Kolhapur
        <span class="gold-text"> for practical clarity and stronger next steps</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Kolhapur hands many people a genuinely different fork than any other Maharashtra city: a cooperative sugar-factory and jaggery-trade economy that runs through cooperative societies rather than corporate employers, a GI-tagged Kolhapuri chappal craft trade under real pressure from machine-made competition, and a famous kushti wrestling and akhada tradition that raises its own career questions once the competitive years pass.
        Most career advice available online is written for a single generic city and misses all three. If you are at a real decision point, the goal is getting clear before more time goes the wrong way, and building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities and moves you toward earlier financial freedom.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Kolhapur and across India. You can start from home, college, a family workshop, or work - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Kolhapur. It is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="local-intent-fit"
    title="Why this decision already feels important"
    subtitle="You want support that feels easier to trust, easier to start, and more useful than generic advice - not another vague conversation."
    items={fitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={fitSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the Kolhapur search already reflects a serious decision, move before more time goes into the wrong direction"
    body="Use this when you want stronger guidance now, not another round of delay while the decision keeps getting more expensive."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Counselling"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Counselling"
